  September 10, 2025, Orem, Utah, USA: George Zinn is taken into custody by
  campus security following the

  fatal shooting of Charlie Kirk during a public event at Utah Valley
  University. At the time of the arrest, Zinn

  was identified as the alleged shooter. He was later released and subsequently
  arrested on unrelated

  charges. Law enforcement confirmed that the actual suspect remained at large
  during this initial

  response. (Credit Image: © Charles-McClintock Wilson/ZUMA Press Wire)
